e\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"June 2026 Component Styling and Chart Customization\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor released updates on June 3, 2026, including improved component styling and added chart customization functionality, along with Organizations-related features.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-06-03\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"v0.77.0 Language Support Expansion\",\n    \"description\": \"Aider released version v0.77.0 with a major upgrade adding 130 new programming languages with linter support via tree-sitter-language-pack, expanding support to over 100 languages total.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Rate Limit Changes and Model Updates\",\n    \"description\": \"Anthropic announced changes to Claude Code rate limits in May 2026, following 6 months of restrictions. The platform also released Claude Opus 4.7 with improvements in software engineering and complex coding tasks.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://levelup.gitconnected.com/stop-hitting-the-5-hour-wall-anthropic-just-doubled-my-claude-code-limits-after-6-months-of-0fd5c2ddca46\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Wave 3 Updates and Enhanced Features\",\n    \"description\": \"Windsurf released Wave 3 updates including better credit tracking, revamped Turbo Mode, and customizable app icons for Mac users. The VS Code extension received updates for better models, context, and control over code items.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/blog/changelist-feb25\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-02-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]",
